cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the paper below."
title: "Legally validated evaluation framework for voice anonymization"
abstract: >-
  Reference implementation of the Singling Out and Linkability metrics, which
  translate the singling out and linkability criteria of the Article 29 Working
  Party's Opinion 05/2014 on Anonymization Techniques into quantitative metrics
  for speech data.
type: software
